cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the associated manuscript and this repository."
title: "GSE341665: reproducible analysis of epithelial Smad4 loss in the dental epithelium"
abstract: >-
  Code and processed data for the study of how epithelial Smad4 deletion reprograms
  ameloblast identity and metabolism, from bulk RNA-seq differential expression through
  gene-program scoring, single-cell deconvolution, and figure generation.
type: software
license: MIT
